    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The ancients believed our lives are told by the Goddess of Story </i><br><i>May she fill yours with hope and adventure...</i> <br> <br>In a world of flying carpets, magical lamps, sorcerers, monsters, and demons - join our intrepid hero Zayd and his plucky sidekick Hudson as they explore the mysterious Islands of the Jinn. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional puzzle dungeons, packed with eerie atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special items and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tropical-themed overworld to explore!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The ancients believed our lives are told by the Goddess of Story </i><br><i>May she fill yours with hope and adventure...</i> <br> <br>In a world of flying carpets, magical lamps, sorcerers, monsters, and demons - join our intrepid hero Zayd and his plucky sidekick Hudson as they explore the mysterious Islands of the Jinn. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional puzzle dungeons, packed with eerie atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special items and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tropical-themed overworld to explore!</p></li></ul>",
